// LuaEngine::TagDispatch -- the tag dispatch entry: one suspendable step that reads the tag name and its attributes, walks the tag table, and answers how many values the handler left on the stack.
//
// The step is suspendable: every gate below replays the call its resume
// code names. Judgment order is untouched -- the goto graph is the
// generated driver's own flattening, renamed labels only.
//
// src: artemis.wasm2c.c 2023626-2023626 (f3744); R1 transcribe-keep.
//
// Written against artemis-compat, with the official WebAssembly decompile
// as the reference: this body reproduces the asyncify module's generated C
// call for call.  The prose below records what this particular step does.
//

